Z||000009||DaRkLoRD||09-30-2001||05:44 PM||||another quick and easy way to get a similar effect, though not always as realistic, is to select the body panels (using the lasso tool, quick mask tool, etc) and then adjust the hue/saturation directly..<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
