Z||000018||AusFiero||10-01-2001||06:23 PM||||I found the best way was to cut out the painted areas of a fiero and paste them on another layer. Then using hue/saturation and colour balance to change to almost any colour. Brightness and contrast also is used to bring them back to a realisitic look.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
