Z||000031||Boomtastic||10-03-2001||02:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>Ok, here's Part 1 of the "Photoshop Paint Job" tutorial..<P>go to the tutorials index and scroll down to the bottom. If there are any questions, please email me.. Those of you who have Photoshop... have fun with this tutorial!!<P>[b] <A HREF="http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/stuff/tutorials/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/stuff/tutorials/index.html</A> </B><P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ooooooooooooooh! I just tried it, and must say it's VERY sweet!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I'll be a pro soon! Thanks for the tips. I can't wait for Part 2 - light colored cars (silver, yellow, etc.) don't work as well as dark cars when "colored".<P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
